#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Safe maintainer CLI for Security Ops OS.

The CLI owns only ``securityops/settings.json``.  It never rewrites the large
hand-maintained Scheme configuration, never evaluates shell text, and never
publishes Git tags or releases.  Guix consumes the settings through
``(securityops settings)``.
"""

